# EtInstrumentIsland Component - Agent Guide

## Overview

`EtInstrumentIsland` is a Dynamic-Island-style instrument switcher inspired by iOS 27's Liquid Glass Dynamic Island. At rest it is a compact "pill" — the focused instrument framed by neighbour dots. A **long press** springs it open into a frosted **Liquid Glass** island holding a center-snapping rail of instruments; the centered one enlarges and is named beneath. Tapping anywhere outside collapses it back. The edges glow with a slowly-rotating, breathing chromatic light.

It is **data-driven and presentational**: you hand it `items` and it reports focus / activation / expansion through callbacks. It owns no business logic and fetches no data.

**Location:** `/libs/etoro-ui/src/components/instrument-island/`

## Key Features

- **Liquid Glass Surface**: Native `EtGlassView` on iOS 26+, with an `expo-blur` `BlurView` fallback elsewhere
- **Alive Chromatic Glow**: Skia-powered rotating sweep gradient + blur that intensifies with expansion and gently breathes (toggle via `glow`)
- **Springy Morph**: A single reanimated `expansion` shared value drives all size/radius/opacity interpolation for a cohesive Dynamic-Island morph
- **Center-Snapping Rail**: Horizontal `ScrollView` with snap offsets; the centered item scales up and becomes "focused"
- **Long-press to Expand / Outside-tap to Collapse**: Full-window backdrop captures the dismiss tap (toggle via `dismissOnOutsidePress`)
- **Haptics**: Selection + impact haptics on iOS (toggle via `haptics`)
- **Controlled / Uncontrolled**: Both `focusedId` and `isExpanded` support controlled and uncontrolled modes
- **Responsive**: Expanded width derives from the screen width (override via `expandedWidth`)

## Usage

```tsx
const [focusedId, setFocusedId] = useState('btc');

<EtInstrumentIsland
  items={[
    { id: 'btc', symbol: 'BTC', label: 'Bitcoin', imageUrl: btcLogo, accentColor: '#F7931A' },
    { id: 'aapl', symbol: 'AAPL', label: 'Apple', imageUrl: aaplLogo },
    { id: 'nvda', symbol: 'NVDA', label: 'Nvidia', imageUrl: nvdaLogo },
    { id: 'trader', symbol: 'JKamil', label: 'Jaynemesis', imageUrl: photo, shape: 'circle' },
  ]}
  focusedId={focusedId}
  onFocusChange={setFocusedId}
  onItemPress={openInstrument}
  accessibilityLabel="Instrument switcher"
/>;
```

Long-press the pill to expand, swipe the rail to change focus, tap a centered item to fire `onItemPress`, tap outside to collapse.

## Data Model — `IslandInstrument`

| Field             | Type          | Description                                                            |
| ----------------- | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `id`              | `string`      | Stable identity used for focus tracking and callbacks                  |
| `symbol`          | `string`      | Short symbol (e.g. "BTC"); default label beneath the focused item      |
| `label`           | `string`      | Optional longer label shown when focused (falls back to `symbol`)      |
| `imageUrl`        | `string`      | Avatar image URL (instrument logo / trader photo)                      |
| `fallback`        | `string`      | Initials rendered when no image is available                           |
| `backgroundColor` | `string`      | Background painted behind a transparent logo                           |
| `shape`           | `AvatarShape` | `'square'` for instruments (default), `'circle'` for people/traders    |
| `accentColor`     | `string`      | Accent color for the alive edge glow when this item is focused         |

## Props Reference — `EtInstrumentIslandProps` (Root)

| Prop                    | Type                          | Default      | Description                                                          |
| ----------------------- | ----------------------------- | ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `items`                 | `IslandInstrument[]`          | required     | Ordered instruments (rail items + collapsed dots)                    |
| `focusedId`             | `string`                      | -            | Controlled focused id (pair with `onFocusChange`)                    |
| `defaultFocusedId`      | `string`                      | first item   | Initial focus (uncontrolled)                                         |
| `onFocusChange`         | `(id: string) => void`        | -            | Fires when the centered/focused item changes                        |
| `onItemPress`           | `(id: string) => void`        | -            | Fires when the focused item is tapped again (e.g. to open it)        |
| `isExpanded`            | `boolean`                     | -            | Controlled expanded state (pair with `onExpandedChange`)             |
| `defaultExpanded`       | `boolean`                     | `false`      | Initial expanded state (uncontrolled)                                |
| `onExpandedChange`      | `(expanded: boolean) => void` | -            | Fires on long-press expand / outside-tap collapse                    |
| `expandedWidth`         | `number`                      | screen-based | Width of the expanded island                                         |
| `glow`                  | `boolean`                     | `true`       | Render the Skia chromatic edge glow                                  |
| `haptics`               | `boolean`                     | `true`       | Fire selection/impact haptics on iOS                                 |
| `dismissOnOutsidePress` | `boolean`                     | `true`       | Render a full-window backdrop so outside taps collapse the island    |
| `style`                 | `StyleProp<ViewStyle>`        | -            | Style overrides for the outer (collapsed-footprint) container        |
| `accessibilityLabel`    | `string`                      | -            | Accessibility label for the collapsed pill                           |
| `testID`                | `string`                      | -            | Forwarded to the outer container (`-trigger`/`-backdrop` suffixes)   |

